WFM Meningioma T1c Ablation Reconstruction
===========================================

This repository contains code derived from and built upon the following works:

1. WFM: 3D Wavelet Flow Matching for Ultrafast Multi-Modal MRI Synthesis
   Authors: Yalcin Tur, Mihajlo Stojkovic, Ulas Bagci
   Repository: https://github.com/yalcintur/WFM
   License: MIT

2. cWDM / wdm-3d
   Author: Paul Friedrich and co-authors
   Repository: https://github.com/pfriedri/wdm-3d
   License: MIT

The meningioma-specific ablation modules, data loader, training scripts,
sampling scripts, registered evaluation, and statistical analysis code were
adapted or reconstructed for the accompanying manuscript.

The original WFM README is included at docs/WFM_ORIGINAL_README.md.
